Unicorns are quite cool -- they can use their uni horn to cure
themselves of blindness or other ailments, and IIRC, they're one of the
fastest units in the whole game. They're also quite fitting with a
role-playing knight to ride such a traditional mythical beast.

However, they don't fly, which puts them at a disadvantage to a dragon,
Ki-Rin or Jabberwock, which are all great mounts.



